From 122b0fa94010e2baf233533f0891a2ec0b251d54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanyog Kale <skale@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 28 Apr 2022 19:20:56 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-82716] common: add direct and indirect i2c oob commands

This patch adds direct and indirect I2C commands as part of
ROM recovery I2C OOB secure firmware update. Following indirect
commands are supported.
1. HL_I2CI_REQ_OP_DEVICE_INFO
2. HL_I2CI_REQ_OP_DEVICE_STATUS
3. HL_I2CI_REQ_OP_CONFIG_ACCESS
4. HL_I2CI_REQ_OP_MEMCPY_CTRL
5. HL_I2CI_REQ_OP_MEMCPY_DATA

All the changes are ported from preboot code.

Change-Id: Id83097c4b3aa0a700945dd6f555b425b3599ee78
---

